  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">법인 등기부등본 is a public document that certifies the identity and status of a corporation.&lt;SEP&gt;법인 등기부등본 refers to the corporate registration document that can be obtained by individuals or organizations for verification or legal purposes.</data>
