<node id="정부24">
  <data key="d0">정부24</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">정부24 is a government website that allows online access to various administrative services including the issuance of 법인 등기부등본.&lt;SEP&gt;정부24 is an online platform that facilitates access to various government services, including the issuance of 법인 등기부등본.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a8b30f520ca5e33de27b8414573087b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4736e8e450518f32893cf6635349861c</data>
