</node>
<node id="인터넷등기소">
  <data key="d0">인터넷등기소</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">인터넷등기소 is an online platform where 법인 등기부등본 can be issued using a digital certificate.&lt;SEP&gt;인터넷등기소 (Internet Registry Office) is an online registry service where 법인 등기부등본 can be issued using an official certificate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a8b30f520ca5e33de27b8414573087b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4736e8e450518f32893cf6635349861c</data>
