<node id="다산콜센터">
  <data key="d0">다산콜센터</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">다산콜센터, also known as Dasan Call Center, is an organization that operates as a comprehensive support and consultation center addressing public inquiries. It specifically provides assistance regarding disaster relief funds, including relevant information on financial support related to events such as the COVID-19 pandemic. The center serves as a vital point of contact for various welfare-related queries and public service supports, which encompass areas like public transportation schedules.

In addition to its role in supporting disaster-related inquiries, 다산콜센터 is responsible for receiving and processing civil complaints, thereby facilitating communication between residents and relevant authorities. It is equipped to handle a range of issues, providing guidance for residents facing maintenance problems, particularly in situations lacking a designated management authority. The center allows customers to apply for financial settlements and offers references for specific support cases, ensuring that residents have access to the necessary information and assistance for their needs.

Through its diverse range of services, 다산콜센터 aims to enhance public access to support systems and streamline the consultation process for citizens facing various challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;The 다산콜센터 (Dasan Call Center) provides support and information regarding public services in Seoul.&lt;SEP&gt;다산콜센터 is a call center serving as a contact point for administrative inquiries related to the city of Seoul.&lt;SEP&gt;다산콜센터 is a service center providing consultation and support, referenced in the extracted text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f84e3c36be541c9320f33f8820b3e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fdd2259269416ad00bf5efa1e3ff75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9d2bb0a7a9356cea2eea34580304805&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a682740acab46c4d831fc64f9458aa6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef70fab1d8ca03eb7850655b892c6c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c7b31a8bce1c77f19769ebb31f5750a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e42fdaab090f90dad1908f4f60a73e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06e06b842cf957226c2391b99c0f5fdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2b16d42e8f440ba909655499b7dc8fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26015b9d8a0ea3cd28adf86db1fb5b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64c2c142d6ae054f44a631a6dd382fc1</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847953</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
