<node id="A차 재난지원금">
  <data key="d0">A차 재난지원금</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A차 재난지원금 is a selective disaster relief fund aimed at providing financial support to those affected by the COVID-19 pandemic in South Korea.&lt;SEP&gt;A차 재난지원금 refers to a specific type of disaster relief fund being distributed as part of government support measures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-edb19e6c37e773b5f29773c61b5e0241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fdd2259269416ad00bf5efa1e3ff75</data>
