<node id="긴급고용안정지원금">
  <data key="d0">긴급고용안정지원금</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">긴급고용안정지원금 is a specific support program designed to assist special types of workers and freelancers during economic hardships.&lt;SEP&gt;긴급고용안정지원금 refers to a specific emergency employment stability support fund provided by the government to assist individuals facing unemployment during the pandemic.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-edb19e6c37e773b5f29773c61b5e0241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9d2bb0a7a9356cea2eea34580304805</data>
