  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">특수형태 근로종사자 refers to individuals in non-standard employment situations who are eligible for the 긴급고용안정지원금.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-edb19e6c37e773b5f29773c61b5e0241</data>
