  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">저소득층 encompasses low-income groups qualifying for the A차 재난지원금, including traditional welfare beneficiaries.&lt;SEP&gt;저소득층 refers to individuals with low income, who may benefit from programs like the 경기도 일하는 청년 통장 for financial assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-edb19e6c37e773b5f29773c61b5e0241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a9680fdc4b264ce8def83b977799b4</data>
