<node id="광진형 소상공인 고용유지지원금">
  <data key="d0">광진형 소상공인 고용유지지원금</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 광진형 소상공인 고용유지지원금 is a financial assistance program intended to support small business owners in 광진구 affected by COVID-19 by providing direct monetary support for a limited duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-317799b4564220b78af1c973d13748bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847488</data>
