  <data key="d0">부가가치세과세표준증명서</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">부가가치세과세표준증명서 is a tax document required for verifying revenue decrease for business owners applying for the 지원금.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-317799b4564220b78af1c973d13748bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847488</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="코로나19">
  <data key="d0">코로나19</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">코로나19, also known as COVID-19, is a viral infection that has resulted in a global pandemic, significantly affecting public health and prompting extensive measures regarding social distancing, travel restrictions, and various government interventions. The outbreak has led governments worldwide to implement support programs aimed at assisting individuals who have been impacted, such as workers needing unpaid leave for caregiving responsibilities.

In particular, 코로나19 has had notable repercussions for small businesses, especially in areas like 광진구, where financial assistance has been necessary to mitigate the economic strain resulting from the pandemic. The widespread nature of the virus has not only caused health concerns but has also led to substantial economic challenges across multiple sectors, including industries such as forestry. 

The pandemic has prompted public inquiries about effective treatment and prevention, highlighting the urgent need for coordinated health responses. Overall, 코로나19 signifies a critical public health crisis with far-reaching impacts on economy and society, necessitating comprehensive policy responses to address both immediate and long-term consequences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-317799b4564220b78af1c973d13748bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fdd2259269416ad00bf5efa1e3ff75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04109b981ea9241e20e0cd41acf75c9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5b3f2a0e7e199b157e1ecf282f2f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2448e9f61e18cf63ddc33e28f683ad4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb82bd12de86730e4607403d562def87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a906344898db2026c83c60f663348594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfd312027589e98cdf3d31f7c2152125</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847847</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="손 소독제">
  <data key="d0">손 소독제</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">손 소독제 refers to hand sanitizers which are necessary for maintaining good hand hygiene as part of the 방역 수칙.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-317799b4564220b78af1c973d13748bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847488</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="마스크">
  <data key="d0">마스크</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">마스크 are face masks that should be worn in enclosed spaces and where maintaining a distance of 2m is difficult.&lt;SEP&gt;마스크 is a face covering that students and staff must wear at all times indoors in the school.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-317799b4564220b78af1c973d13748bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8d1e1a1842bcf0d62427ca219f9ba67</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847729</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="손 씻기">
  <data key="d0">손 씻기</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">손 씻기 refers to the method of washing hands for at least 30 seconds with running water and soap as part of the 방역 수칙.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-317799b4564220b78af1c973d13748bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Water Meter">
  <data key="d0">Water Meter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Water Meter is the device used to measure water consumption, central to the inquiry about excess charges.&lt;SEP&gt;The Water Meter is a device used to measure water consumption, with a dial indicator referred to as a star-pointer (별침) used for leak detection.&lt;SEP&gt;The water meter is a device that measures water usage and is integral to assessing potential leaks in plumbing systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Water Meter is used to measure the quantity of water consumed and is subject to performance testing if discrepancies are suspected.&lt;SEP&gt;Water Meter is a device used to measure the volume of water consumed by a household or unit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245bda255670ccd48c09a947ca704979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4c20f35db93bd19f5ea218034651bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-895d23911c039abf2918ff56cb07b552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338619afb67b6532013505721187e7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847846</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leak Detection">
  <data key="d0">Leak Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Leak Detection is a process to identify water leaks either large or small, indicated by the movement of the star-pointer on the water meter.&lt;SEP&gt;Leak Detection is the process of identifying leaks in plumbing systems to ascertain the cause of high water bills.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9bbf7a94b6250c06b1f762921ca7f1</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847549</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bathroom">
  <data key="d0">Bathroom</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bathroom is a potential leak-checking area where sounds of running water from the toilet tank should be monitored.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Kitchen">
  <data key="d0">Kitchen</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Kitchen is another area where checking for leaks should involve inspecting under the sink and around the water heater.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Boiler Room">
  <data key="d0">Boiler Room</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Boiler Room is a part of the building where heating is managed, also suggested as an area to check for leaks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boiler Room is a location where connections to the boiler and washing machine faucets should be inspected for leaks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245bda255670ccd48c09a947ca704979</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leak Repair Company">
  <data key="d0">Leak Repair Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Leak Repair Company is a specialized service provider that can be found via internet searches for leak detection services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Water Bill Discount Application">
  <data key="d0">Water Bill Discount Application</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Water Bill Discount Application is a process for residents to request a reduction in their water bill due to indoor leaks after repairs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Municipal Water Authority">
  <data key="d0">Municipal Water Authority</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Municipal Water Authority is the local governing body responsible for water supply management and regulation in a specific area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Water Meter Reading">
  <data key="d0">Water Meter Reading</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Water Meter Reading is the recorded measurement of water usage over a specific period, critical for billing and leak detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb1dd8dc5e2f9c7fcb16fd507922082f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Water Bill">
  <data key="d0">Water Bill</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Water Bill reflects the charges for water usage, which in this context is reported as excessively high at 900,000 won.&lt;SEP&gt;The Water Bill refers to the statement of charges for water usage, which may be affected by leaks or other issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The Water Bill contains details about charges for water supply and drainage services, and includes the Customer Number.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-245bda255670ccd48c09a947ca704979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9bbf7a94b6250c06b1f762921ca7f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225cfd3c63e0d9d70f9e4f6756ef3e8d</data>
