  <data key="d0">Leakage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Leakage refers to the loss of water due to leaks within pipes, which is suspected as the cause for the high water bill.&lt;SEP&gt;Leakage refers to the unintended escape of water from plumbing fixtures, requiring diagnostic and repair intervention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-245bda255670ccd48c09a947ca704979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d0b085a333803c26889a3c63b1a8e30</data>
