  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sink refers to a household fixture where water is used, mentioned as a potential source to check for leaks.&lt;SEP&gt;The sink is an element in the kitchen where the white stains have been observed, potentially caused by minerals in the tap water.</data>
