<node id="Dasan Call Center">
  <data key="d0">Dasan Call Center</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Dasan Call Center is a comprehensive service in Seoul dedicated to addressing a variety of citizen inquiries, particularly those related to water issues. It serves as a primary contact point for residents to apply for leak detection services, seek assistance with water bills, and obtain information regarding water-related benefits. 

In addition to water services, the Dasan Call Center also provides support with inquiries related to property taxes and other public concerns, showcasing its role as a multifaceted governmental resource. The center is particularly valued for its consulting capabilities, often referenced in inquiry case studies to illustrate effective citizen support mechanisms. 

Moreover, the Dasan Call Center has adapted its services to current public health needs by offering consultations pertaining to COVID-19 guidelines. This versatility further emphasizes its importance as a resource for the community. Additionally, the center facilitates applications for free water quality tests and offers assistance with complaints related to water quality and pipe issues, thereby ensuring residents have access to vital information and services that impact their daily lives.&lt;SEP&gt;Dasan Call Center is an organization associated with public inquiries and tax concerns, referenced in the source dialogue regarding reasan tax.&lt;SEP&gt;Dasan Call Center is a customer service center that assists individuals with inquiries related to water service and billing, such as moving procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-245bda255670ccd48c09a947ca704979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9bbf7a94b6250c06b1f762921ca7f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f553536aaaeba92fcd9d0586beb4e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cda3abda4c6819aedd3f0c6a84c21d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0928e60540839c3ce03e7a599712cad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a521e72858f13aa5823dd1ff96861c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a2bcc44266d0bec6c81b78871ee223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fffd9e71d21770dc7f07084c09890a46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7459f2a288aa2b51e24609349a9f0871&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9e9783dbd8f133cbf76bf641370d7e</data>
