<node id="복지로 웹사이트">
  <data key="d0">복지로 웹사이트</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The 복지로 웹사이트 is a resource for checking available welfare support programs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3784934e9c1843ee3a5dab7333fbeb0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="보건복지부">
  <data key="d0">보건복지부</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The 보건복지부 (Ministry of Health and Welfare) is responsible for establishing and announcing the criteria for support in South Korea.&lt;SEP&gt;The 보건복지부 is the government ministry responsible for overseeing the 긴급복지 생계지원금 and other welfare programs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3784934e9c1843ee3a5dab7333fbeb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760fc96eeb75a2dffb0a3ff9ce6121df</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="긴급복지 지원제도">
  <data key="d0">긴급복지 지원제도</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 긴급복지 지원제도 is a program aimed at providing rapid support services in emergencies, including basic livelihood, medical, and housing assistance to low-income families facing sudden crises.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3784934e9c1843ee3a5dab7333fbeb0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="기준 중위소득">
  <data key="d0">기준 중위소득</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 기준 중위소득 (Median Income Standard) is the income threshold for support eligibility, set at 75% of the median income.&lt;SEP&gt;기준 중위소득 refers to the median income level used to determine eligibility for government support programs, including the 긴급복지 생계지원금.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3784934e9c1843ee3a5dab7333fbeb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760fc96eeb75a2dffb0a3ff9ce6121df</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="위기 상황">
  <data key="d0">위기 상황</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">위기 상황 describes circumstances that make it difficult for households to maintain their livelihood, qualifying them for the 긴급복지 생계지원금.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3784934e9c1843ee3a5dab7333fbeb0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Indoor Water Leakage">
  <data key="d0">Indoor Water Leakage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Indoor water leakage refers to the problem of water leaking into lower units in multi-family housing, potentially causing property damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Water Supply Office">
  <data key="d0">Water Supply Office</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Water Supply Office handles queries and inspections related to water leakage issues but does not perform repairs directly.&lt;SEP&gt;The Water Supply Office is the governing body responsible for managing water supply issues and handling water meter performance tests.&lt;SEP&gt;The Water Supply Office handles the applications for water supply termination and oversees the necessary procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-895d23911c039abf2918ff56cb07b552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9af6c5ec838421d3638d894a06edce</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847730</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aging Pipes">
  <data key="d0">Aging Pipes</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Aging pipes are a common cause of indoor water leakage, often found in bathrooms and sinks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Expert Diagnosis">
  <data key="d0">Expert Diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Expert diagnosis is necessary for accurately locating the source of water leakage, as appearance alone is not sufficient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Specialized Repair Company">
  <data key="d0">Specialized Repair Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A specialized repair company is required to undertake necessary repairs after a leak has been diagnosed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lower Unit">
  <data key="d0">Lower Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The lower unit is the apartment or living space affected by water leakage from the unit above.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Passenger">
  <data key="d0">Passenger</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A passenger is an individual traveling on an aircraft who may bring pets along under specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pet Carrier">
  <data key="d0">Pet Carrier</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A pet carrier is a transport container used for bringing pets onto aircraft, subject to size and weight regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dog">
  <data key="d0">Dog</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">A dog is a type of pet that can be transported on an aircraft if it meets the airline's regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cat">
  <data key="d0">Cat</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">A cat is another type of pet that can accompany passengers on an aircraft under specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bird">
  <data key="d0">Bird</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">A bird is a type of pet mentioned as permissible for transport on flights, alongside dogs and cats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-294ae62e22a81ccd262ff4e26e729b73</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847548</data>
