  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">2차 재난지원금 refers to the second round of disaster relief funds provided by the government, which has officially ended and is no longer accepting applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9d2bb0a7a9356cea2eea34580304805</data>
