</node>
<node id="복지로">
  <data key="d0">복지로</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">복지로 is a website providing information on various welfare support programs available to the public in South Korea.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9d2bb0a7a9356cea2eea34580304805</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847550</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="자가격리">
  <data key="d0">자가격리</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">자가격리는 감염병 예방을 위해 개인이 사회적 접촉을 줄이기 위해 자발적으로 격리되는 상태를 의미한다.&lt;SEP&gt;자가격리 is a recommended health measure for individuals who test positive for 코로나19, requiring them to isolate for a specific duration to prevent further transmission.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85b4a19992d0ed0259cc8a47883f3176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb82bd12de86730e4607403d562def87</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847670</data>
