  <data key="d1">financialaid</data>
  <data key="d2">청년구직활동지원금 is a financial support program designed to assist unemployed youth in South Korea by providing monthly allowances for up to six months.&lt;SEP&gt;청년구직활동지원금 is a government support program aimed at assisting young job seekers in finding employment.</data>
