  <data key="d2">Villa is a type of multi-unit housing structure where water pressure issues may occur.&lt;SEP&gt;A villa is a type of multi-story residential building where residents reported low water pressure issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A Villa is a type of residential building where concerns regarding water leakage were raised in the context of plumbing issues.</data>
