  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">생활지원금 refers to the living support funds available for those who take unpaid leave due to COVID-19 quarantine.&lt;SEP&gt;생활지원금 is a financial assistance program for employees on unpaid leave due to quarantine or isolation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d5b3f2a0e7e199b157e1ecf282f2f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7409884c6a7155d8a0daaf1585f5e8fd</data>
