  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">무급휴가 signifies unpaid leave that workers must take to qualify for living support funds.&lt;SEP&gt;무급휴가는 근로자가 급여를 받지 않고 휴가를 사용하는 상황을 나타낸다.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d5b3f2a0e7e199b157e1ecf282f2f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7409884c6a7155d8a0daaf1585f5e8fd</data>
