  <data key="d0">지원대상</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">지원대상 refers to the target recipients of the family caregiving leave program who have specific eligibility based on their circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d5b3f2a0e7e199b157e1ecf282f2f45</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847613</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="수도요금">
  <data key="d0">수도요금</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">수도요금은 물 사용에 대한 요금으로, 상수도, 하수도 및 물이용분담금을 포함한다.&lt;SEP&gt;수도요금 is the charge levied for water consumption as measured by the 수도계량기.&lt;SEP&gt;수도요금 represents the charge for water services, which can be affected by various schemes for deductions.&lt;SEP&gt;Water utility charges are payments based on the consumption tracked by a water meter that need to be settled during a move.&lt;SEP&gt;수도요금 represents the water bill that needs to be settled during a move.&lt;SEP&gt;수도요금 is the fee charged for water supply services that can lead to penalties if unpaid.&lt;SEP&gt;수도요금 refers to the water charges or rates that residents are billed for water usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a20ff5a175948ed968825205f05edf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a682740acab46c4d831fc64f9458aa6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8739fd78904ada5332d5488076d84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c7b31a8bce1c77f19769ebb31f5750a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5fd5f90104cdd435a3370d45417fc97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c88207e7762266f17ec8813caad8533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2b16d42e8f440ba909655499b7dc8fb</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847953</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="상수도 요금">
  <data key="d0">상수도 요금</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">상수도 요금은 깨끗한 물을 공급하는 비용으로, 1톤당 요금이 정해져 있다.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a20ff5a175948ed968825205f05edf0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847613</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="하수도 요금">
  <data key="d0">하수도 요금</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">하수도 요금은 사용한 물을 정화하여 방류하는 비용으로, 사용량에 따라 달라진다.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a20ff5a175948ed968825205f05edf0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762847613</data>
