<node id="Sports Events">
  <data key="d0">Sports Events</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sports events, including baseball games, are conducted without spectators due to restrictions on gatherings.&lt;SEP&gt;Sports events are organized competitions that are impacted by social distancing measures, particularly requiring no spectators.</data>
