  <data key="d0">귀촌인</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">귀촌인 refers to individuals who have moved from urban areas to rural regions and are seeking to establish their new lives, particularly in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;귀촌인 refers to individuals who have moved to rural communities, often seeking support for establishing businesses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb82bd12de86730e4607403d562def87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ccb6b289d63579e91b40c8ae5fb5930</data>
