  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">주택 refers to residential buildings for which property tax is paid in two installments if the annual amount exceeds 200,000 won.&lt;SEP&gt;주택 refers to a physical real estate property used for residential purposes, which has specific tax rates applied during acquisition.</data>
