  <data key="d0">관할 수도사업소</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">관할 수도사업소 is the local water authority that oversees the installation and management of individual water meters for residential units.&lt;SEP&gt;관할 수도사업소 is the local water supply office responsible for managing water supply issues including repairs of frozen water meters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-696bf3ac1c7785a746a2ba8e034bde06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d8ad8036606e5cc6b85c6c78d0181a8</data>
